Pull on the rope connected to my thumping chest

142
00:16:25,884 --> 00:16:27,444
いくよ
Here we go!

143
00:16:27,444 --> 00:16:30,364
bet bet bet on ! bet bet bet on ! bet on chu !
Bet bet bet on! Bet bet bet on! Bet on chu!

144
00:16:30,364 --> 00:16:34,364
bet bet bet on ! bet bet bet bet on chu !
Bet bet bet on! Bet bet bet bet on chu!

145
00:16:34,364 --> 00:16:38,184
マジで狂えるくらいの鬱鬱しさ/鬱鬱しさが美しいでしょ
The madness of being truly crazy is beautiful, right?

146
00:16:38,184 --> 00:16:40,444
...
Pulling strings...

147
00:16:40,444 --> 00:16:44,224
get get get on ! get get get on ! get on chu !
Get get get on! Get get get on! Get on chu!

148
00:16:44,224 --> 00:16:47,364
get get get on ! get get get get on chu !
Get get get on! Get get get get on chu!

149
